🛡️ Digital Footprint Intelligence Dashboard
Day 20 / 60 — Claude AI Mastery Challenge
Built with Claude (Anthropic) | Single-file HTML | No backend required
A premium, cybersecurity-style dashboard that analyzes a user's app ecosystem and generates a full Digital Footprint & Privacy Intelligence Report — complete with exposure scoring, company risk ranking, a live-animated Risk Radar, a Digital Twin profile, and an interactive Privacy Improvement Simulator.
🎯 What It Does
Given a list of apps a person uses (Instagram, WhatsApp, Google Pay, TikTok, etc.), the dashboard:
Calculates a Digital Footprint Score (0–100) — how much of a footprint you leave
Calculates a Privacy Score (0–100) — how protected that footprint is
Maps exposure intensity per app via a visual heatmap
Ranks parent companies (Google, Meta, ByteDance...) by combined data exposure
Builds a Data Collection Matrix — what category of data each app likely touches
Renders a Risk Radar across 6 dimensions (Social, Financial, Location, Behavioral, Communication, Identity)
Generates a Digital Twin Profile — a probabilistic sketch of the likely user behind the app stack
Surfaces the Most Valuable Data Assets an advertiser would want
Runs a live Privacy Improvement Simulator — tick real actions, watch your score move in real time
Closes with a Final Verdict card, graded like a credit report
🧠 Why This Matters
Most people have no idea how their everyday app choices compound into a tracking profile. This tool makes that visible — instantly, visually, and without ever touching a real account or private database.
⚠️ Full transparency built into the design itself:
Every insight is labeled FACT (directly from the app list) or ESTIMATE (a reasoned, non-certain inference). No claims of certainty. No access to real user data. Ever.
